  "libraryMerkabaBreath": "Inhale 4 seconds. Hold 4 seconds. Exhale 6 seconds.\nEvery inhale creates. Every hold is organized. Every exhale reveals.\nBreath is the invisible architect. Air is the medium. Light is the material. Geometry is the result.",
  "libraryMerkabaScene1": "0:00–0:40 Human Blueprint. A figure of light with a pulsing heart traces the five-pointed star. Gyan Mudra. Presence and awareness.",
