  "libraryMerkabaScene5": "4:30–5:00 The Heart Blossoms. The Merkaba slows, its lines soften and bloom into the Anahata heart mandala. Anjali. Integration and gratitude.",
  "libraryMerkabaCues": "One clear chime cues Inhale (4 seconds). A soft sustained shimmer cues Hold (4 seconds). A warm lower chime cues Exhale (6 seconds).",

